{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_05_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_05","title":"风雨欲来","storyCode":"WB-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7be400afa4b44f105baf2af67e164894459343e4d8c2238772b4da52ed1ac7fb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"截云在城中徘徊，等待出城的时机，也好奇地打量着这个陌生的移动城市。另一方面，这一切的幕后主使主动出现在林雨霞面前。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"日渐西斜。\n人和城墙的影子都被拉得很长。影子盖过了路边的铺面，店家便收起阳伞，伸了一个漫长的懒腰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懒的摊贩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后几件，七折清仓，卖完回家吃饭喽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无聊的摊贩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，还惦记着卖你那没开刃的兵器模型呐，现在的游客早就不吃那套了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懒的摊贩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要真会铸剑的手艺，肯定也得去军营里做些大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无聊的摊贩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，昨天我还真见到一个游客佩着一把赤红色的剑，看起来真不一般。也不知道是从哪儿搞来的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女茫然地看着四周。眼前尽是从未见过的景象。\n脚下地面传来隐隐的震动感，大概是移动城市减速的征兆。但路上的行人却似乎习以为常，有条不紊地做着平常的事。\n晚饭的香气钻入鼻腔。少女这才想起，自己已经整整两天没有吃过东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"浑身的酸痛随着饿意一起袭来。\n双腿也不听自己使唤，跟着香味走向了一家饭馆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伙计","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人要点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旁边那桌人吃的......我也要一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伙计","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，三号桌烤肉凉面一份——"},{"type":"narration","text":"临近晚饭的时间，店里已经差不多坐满。对于朴实的人们来说，忙碌了一天后，一顿踏实的晚饭，就是最好的慰藉。\n墙上的电视机里循环播放着刀光剑影的故事，偶有食客抬起头，被熟悉的桥段吸引一阵注意力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个盒子里的人，为什么看起来和他一模一样？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他旁边的女侠，和师父有点像，又不太像......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（“故事由真实事件改编”又是什么意思......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伙计","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客官您的面来了，慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就说应该送一幅百米长卷，让城里每个人都签上名字，这样的饯别礼物才有意义！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是傻，宗师是要走的，这么大一件东西你让他怎么带得走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反正都是心意，不如多备点我们这儿的特色美食，还实在一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说......那位宗师到底守了玉门多少年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"具体我也说不清楚，只知道我爹那一辈的人出生的时候，宗师就已经守在这儿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那他岂不是已经有一百多岁了？怪不得要离任，应该是身体吃不消了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我听一些江湖人说，就在前阵子还有人见过他。看上去就是一副平常中年男人的样貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那位宗师，不是正常人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听说这世上有些人，就是有用法术延年益寿的本事，宗师他大概也是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管他到底是什么人，我们只要记得他是守护玉门城的大英雄，住在这儿的人，都应该记着他的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，从来没有听说宗师他有过婚配，或是有一儿半女的。明明左将军的公子都这么大了，真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们说，那个人是......英雄？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伙计","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，这饭也吃完了......还算合口味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，很好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伙计","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这饭钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来付吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢、谢谢你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒没什么啦......真巧，又见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是弄丢了钱包，还是忘了带够钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......弄丢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？真倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来你也是刚来的样子，应该对这里也不熟悉。我和你一起去报官吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的好意，还是不用了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次的饭钱，我回头会还给你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带着的这把剑......就是你之前说过，要找的那把？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要抢么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么会平白无故抢别人的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我听说，最近城中有一把很特殊的剑失窃，该不会就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先告辞了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说不能和习武之人开这种玩笑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况是世上所有习武之人里练得最刻苦、最厉害的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他要是一个条件反射，闭着眼对我一拳挥过来，我是不是就要交待在这了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也只好把他抓起来，判一个过失杀人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，怎么说，刚才那个赌该算我赢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才和梁洵打赌，就赌你进门看见我俩是什么反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他赌你会扭头就走，我赌你会愣在原地一句话都讲不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"论看人的本事，我也从来没见过有谁能胜过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况还不是别人，是我的结义兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心，槐琥不知道你在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是再不解风情，也知道该为父女重逢好好准备一个合适的场合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不像旁边这位知府大人，有十几年没见面，找我的第一件事就把我卷进了一个天大的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那件事，的确是我亏欠你的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再数落你，算不算指桑骂槐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，这没有别人，就我们三兄弟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备了酒和菜，坐下来聊聊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g10_yumenfair"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"按小姐给的情报，所有可疑仓库的地址都发到你们的终端上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"从东到西，挨个去查。时间紧张，动作都麻利点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"查到情况不要轻举妄动，先跟大伙联络，我们一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那人反应很快，在道上摸爬滚打了许多年，他分得清什么时候该打，什么时候该逃。\n可是他刚转过身去，就察觉到一只手轻轻搭在他的肩头，仅是这样，他就再也动弹不得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然要找我，为什么又要逃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？ (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子办事挺机灵，但少了点胆魄。改了这个毛病，将来或许能另有成就。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人缓缓收回了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去告诉你家林特使，今天申时正，城南五街七坊仓库。我等她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没到下班的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底对身体不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不喝酒，也不说话，这三双眼睛干瞪着算怎么回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人刚刚不还说有话要问他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间不借酒，有些话也说不出口了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有话直说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这些年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游历四方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到一个地方就找能一战的对手，直到找不到为止。然后就再换一个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前见到梁大人，我还要细细揣摩一下这些年他的变化。槐武痴的变化，倒是直接写在脸上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里变了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也真的担心过，要是哪天突然得知你死于和别人的交手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有道是，人外有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你最终到了玉门......有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有人答应与我比武。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短则三五年，长则十余年。他是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初说要争一个天下闻名的槐天裴，居然也会这样......耐得住寂寞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正找不到别的对手，在这边等几年又何妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就在这家医馆当了三年伙计。"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒倒入杯中，香气却被药味盖过。酒入愁肠，嘴里只剩苦味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“白头翁”“刀伤木”“羽不泊”“千里及”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在玉门武行打听了大半月，却怎么也没有想到，你就在客栈对面的这家医馆里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠了债，总是要还的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你也该清楚，在这世上你亏欠最多的人是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得，我要说的话已经说完了，梁大人还有什么话要问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来探望老朋友，看看他过得怎么样，不该算“问话”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐天裴在玉门待了三年，你来到玉门也有些时日，偏偏选这个时候来探望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城中风波未定，不是顾及私情的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人一心为国，还不允许我们这些老百姓有些私情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要是诚心想叙旧，我就再坐上一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说句话也不爽利，我们怎么变成了这副样子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"槐天裴端起了面前的酒，一饮而尽，转身离开了房间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，得到想要的答案了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是作为槐天裴的义弟，还是作为玉门参知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也该习惯了总是被你看透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你该改改总是招揽麻烦事的习惯，至少别让自己连个能说话的人都找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一件事，他或许是恰当的人选......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像上次你挑我来送那个盏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么复杂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还是那个槐天裴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是最难变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欲买桂花同载酒，终不似，少年游。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还能坐在一张桌子上聊上几句喝一杯酒，就已经是难能可贵的事。非要找回过去的那段日子，反倒像是刻舟求剑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要拦我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两天发生了许多事，我也没有搞太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你没有恶意，最好能留下来，帮忙把事情说清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有时间......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出手里的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人是跟着你过来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天，在城里到处作乱的人，就是你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知死活的小——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个人......之前和我比武的时候，难道还没有尽全力吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥 (A)","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些坏人，只有这点实力，为什么还敢这么猖狂？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
